    "title": "Printable NCAA bracket for 2026 March Madness predictions and picks",
    "text": "Updated March 15, 2026, 10:27 p.m. ETMarch Madness is here, and so is your printable bracket for the 2026 NCAA Tournament.The 2026 bracket will be revealed at 6 p.m. ET on Selection Sunday, shortly after the conclusion of the Big Ten Tournament championship game between Michigan and Purdue.The Wolverines are expected to be a No. 1 seed, and Michigan State basketball is expected to earn another strong seed under Tom Izzo.Ready to make your predictions for how far Michigan, MSU and the rest of the field will go?Here's how to print your bracket: Printable bracket pdf for March MadnessWhat time does NCAA Selection Show start?The NCAA Tournament Selection Show is at 6 p.m. on CBS. Michigan and Michigan State will find out the opponents, dates and sites of their first-round games.Michigan is playing in the Big Ten tournament championship game on Sunday against Purdue, though the outcome of that game is not expected to affect their likely No. 1 seed in the NCAA Tournament.When does March Madness bracket come out?The full NCAA Tournament March Madness bracket will be set after the conclusion of the selection show, which runs from 6-7 p.m. ET on CBS.➤BRACKET CHALLENGE: Think you can beat our expert? Join USA TODAY’s Bracket Challenge today!➤SURVIVOR POOL: Ready to win March Madness? Join USA TODAY’s Survivor Pool today!",
